{"from":"1:1","body":"<p><ref to=\"JUD.1.1\">1</ref> He exhorts them to be constant in the profession of the faith.<br/><ref to=\"JUD.1.4\">4</ref> False teachers are crept in to seduce them, for whose evil doctrine and manners horrible punishment is prepared;<br/><ref to=\"JUD.1.20\">20</ref> whereas the godly, by the assistance of the Holy Spirit, and prayers to God, may persevere, and grow in grace, and keep themselves, and recover others out of the snares of those deceivers.<br/><br/><br/>A. D. 66. A. M. 4070.<br/>Jude.<br/><ref to=\"MAT.10.3\">Mt 10:3</ref><br/>Lebbeus, Thaddeus.<br/><ref to=\"MRK.3.18\">Mr 3:18</ref><br/>Thaddeus.<br/><ref to=\"LUK.6.16 JHN.14.22 ACT.1.13\">Lu 6:16; Joh 14:22; Ac 1:13</ref><br/>the servant.<br/><ref to=\"JHN.12.26 ACT.27.23 ROM.1.1 ROM.6.22 ROM.16.18 JAS.1.1 2PE.1.1\">Joh 12:26; Ac 27:23; Ro 1:1; 6:22; 16:18; Jas 1:1; 2Pe 1:1</ref><br/>them.<br/><ref to=\"JHN.15.16 JHN.17.17 JHN.17.19 ACT.20.32 1CO.1.2 1CO.6.11 EPH.5.26 1TH.5.23\">Joh 15:16; 17:17,19; Ac 20:32; 1Co 1:2; 6:11; Eph 5:26; 1Th 5:23</ref><br/><ref to=\"1PE.1.2\">1Pe 1:2</ref><br/>preserved.<br/><ref to=\"JHN.6.39 JHN.10.28-JHN.10.30 JHN.17.11 JHN.17.12 JHN.17.15 2TI.4.18 1PE.1.5\">Joh 6:39; 10:28-30; 17:11,12,15; 2Ti 4:18; 1Pe 1:5</ref><br/>and called.<br/><ref to=\"ROM.8.30 ROM.9.24 1TH.2.12 2TH.2.13 2TH.2.14 2TI.1.9 HEB.3.1 1PE.2.9 1PE.5.10\">Ro 8:30; 9:24; 1Th 2:12; 2Th 2:13,14; 2Ti 1:9; Heb 3:1; 1Pe 2:9; 5:10</ref></p>"}
